function generateLevel(i,animals=MILESTONE>=5){if(i>=18)return expertLevel(i,animals);const level=levelData(i),rand=rng(94013+i*7717);let best=null,bestFirst=6;const attempts=level.tier===3?12:level.tier===2?3:1;for(let attempt=0;attempt<attempts;attempt++){let columns=witnessQueue(level,rand,animals);if(level.tier>0){for(const col of columns)for(let j=col.length-1;j>0;j--){if(rand()<(level.tier===3?.95:.38)){const k=Math.floor(rand()*(j+1));[col[j],col[k]]=[col[k],col[j]];}}}const s=createState(level,columns),result=solve(s,3000);if(!result.route)continue;const first=level.tier>=2?winningFirst(s,1000):{safe:[],unknown:false};const n=level.tier>=2?first.safe.length:5;if(!best||n<bestFirst){best={columns,par:result.route.length,route:result.route,verified:true,winningFirst:first.safe,firstMovesUnknown:first.unknown,solverVisits:result.visits};bestFirst=n;}if(level.tier<2||(n<=2&&!first.unknown))break;}
